{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43475","headline":"月映清淮流 · 无名氏","name":"月映清淮流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮月秋偏静，含虚夜转明。\n桂花窥镜发，蟾影映波生。\n澹灩轮初上，裴回魄正盈。\n遥塘分草树，近浦写山城。\n桐柏流光逐，蠙珠濯景清。\n孤舟方利涉，更喜照前程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}